  "body": "# Create Live 5 - Skyblock Edition\n\nWelcome to **Create Live 5 - Skyblock Edition**, where innovation meets the limitless skies! Prepare to embark on an extraordinary journey in the boundless expanse of the skies, powered by the unparalleled creativity of the Create mod. This unique modpack brings a whole new playstyle to the classic Skyblock experience, enriched with an array of exciting Create addons.\n\nCreate Live started as a Modpack for a german content creator group, which wanted to play with the mod Create.\n\n[<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/55f5729a3abcb393a3fe9a1317589675ba00a2a7.png\" width=\"350\">](https://blizzor.de/cl5-server)\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/jbCJd3r8LfM\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>",
